# Custom Log File Creator - Quark 1.4
print Initialising Custom Logger System...

# Prompt for filename and log entry
input Enter log filename (e.g. my_notes.txt): -> log_filename
input What is your project status? -> entry

# Save entry and time to the custom filename variable
append log_filename time
append log_filename entry
append log_filename ---------------------------

print Log saved successfully!
print Here is the full content of log_filename:
read log_filename